      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_0320_rival_01",
      "hash64": "BA4146DC052E9BAD",
      "text": "Hey! It’s me, Nemona![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0320_rival_02",
      "hash64": "BA4143DC052E9694",
      "text": "We should call and catch each other up on how\\nthings are going from now on![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0320_rival_03",
      "hash64": "BA4144DC052E9847",
      "text": "You decided to set out heading west from the\\nschool, right, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0320_rival_04",
      "hash64": "BA4141DC052E932E",
      "text": "Starting from there, you’ll be pretty close to\\nCortondo.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0320_rival_05",
      "hash64": "BA4142DC052E94E1",
      "text": "That’s where you’ll find the Bug-type Gym!\\nYou can go take on the Gym Leader if you want![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0320_rival_06",
      "hash64": "BA413FDC052E8FC8",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]I’m sure you can beat her,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\r\\nGood\\r\\nluck—I’ll\\r\\ncall\\r\\nya soon![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
