          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_0320_friend_02",
      "hash64": "BC71D05D2B33ECB2",
      "text": "It’s me—Arven! I was a bit worried ’bout whether\\nor not you’d managed to set out yet.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_0320_friend_03",
      "hash64": "BC71D15D2B33EE65",
      "text": "You did end up deciding to set out east, right?\\nAfter leaving the school?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0320_friend_04",
      "hash64": "BC71CA5D2B33E280",
      "text": "If so, you’re not that far from the area where the\\nStony Cliff Titan is said to make its lair.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0320_friend_05",
      "hash64": "BC71CB5D2B33E433",
      "text": "Stories say it clings to cliffs—practically becomes\\npart of the stone—then attacks from above![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0320_friend_06",
      "hash64": "BC71CC5D2B33E5E6",
      "text": "Though...maybe don’t be staring up overhead all\\nthe time looking for a Titan, only to go tumbling\\r\\noff some cliff you didn’t see.\\c\\nIf that ever does happen, you can open your map\\napp and call yourself a Flying Taxi to pick you up.\\c\\nSome of those rocky areas are like a real maze,\\nso try not to get lost, little buddy.\\c\\nAnd if you find a Titan, let me know![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
